workedExamples.question_text:
Identify the function shown as $y=\sin x$, $y=\cos x$ or $y=\tan x$. State its period, amplitude, intercepts and minimum points on $[-2\pi,2\pi]$. State its unrestricted domain and range, describe its symmetry, and identify where it is positive on $[0,2\pi]$.
